{"id":"wenigstens","lemma":"wenigstens","pos":"adv","rank":549,"glosses":["at least"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/De-wenigstens.ogg/De-wenigstens.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Gib mir wenigstens eine Chance!","en":"At least give me a chance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760974","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"chance"}]},{"text":"Kannst du es wenigstens versuchen?","en":"Can you at least try?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to try, to attempt"}]},{"text":"Ich muss es wenigstens probieren.","en":"I have to at least try.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756475","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to try"}]},{"text":"Du solltest wenigstens \"danke\" sagen.","en":"You should at least say thank you.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},null,{"g":"thanks, thank you"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]},{"text":"Wenigstens war ich nicht allein.","en":"At least I wasn't alone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760185","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"alone"}]}]}